# Test artefacts
logs/
*.log
bochsout.txt

# Python bytecode from the tools
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Fuzzing. The corpus is regenerated by `make fuzz-seed` from artefacts the
# build itself produces, and then grown by libFuzzer - a fuzzer-grown corpus
# is machine- and campaign-specific, and it reaches tens of megabytes within
# a few minutes. tools/fuzz-seed.py is the thing worth version control.
tests/fuzz/corpus/
crash-*
leak-*
timeout-*
oom-*
